rows.original:
"Have you been getting along with everyone?" you ask.

Alante nods. [bri.recruited
    |"Your friends have been very welcoming. [brint.isBrienne
        |Especially Brienne – I get the sense she is trying to make sure I do not miss my home." She smiles. "She is becoming a good friend."
        |Especially Brint – I get the sense he is trying to make sure I do not miss my home." She smiles. "He is becoming a good friend."
    ]
]

[cait.recruited
    |"Cait is very nice. She is very inquisitive, isn't she?" Alante says, chuckling. "But an avid listener and a good storyteller. I find myself enchanted by the tales she weaves of her homeland. Perhaps we could visit someday."
]

[azyrran.recruited
    |"I have found Azyrran to be good company," Alante says. "She is quite similar to myself, I think. I find it fascinating that there can be common links between two cultures so far apart... we are not as unlike as appearance would have you believe."
]

[var0
    |Alante nods. "They are pleasant people. I have not made any lasting friends among them, but I like them. And they support you, [pc.name], which is more important than anything."
]

rows.translation:
“你和大家都相处得不错吧？”你问道。

阿兰特点了点头。 [bri.recruited
    |“你的朋友们都非常热情好客。” [brint.isBrienne
        |“尤其是布蕾妮——我感觉她一直在努力确保我不会想念我的家乡。”她微笑着说，“她正在成为一个很好的朋友。”
        |“尤其是布林特——我感觉他在努力确保我不会想念我的家乡。”她微笑着说，“他正在成为一个很好的朋友。”
    ]
]

[cait.recruited
    |“凯特人很好，她总是充满好奇心，不是吗？”阿兰特笑着说，“但她很爱听人说话，也很会讲故事。她讲述自己家乡的故事时，总能让我听得入迷。也许有一天我们可以一起去那里看看吧。”
]

[azyrran.recruited
    |“我发现阿兹兰是个很不错的伙伴，”阿兰特说道，“我觉得她和我有很多相似之处。能够发现两种相距如此遥远的文化之间竟然存在共性，真是令人着迷……其实，我们之间的差异并没有外表看上去那么大。”
