[var3
    |You enter the teyarium and immediately note the temperature difference, the warm air caressing your bare body.

    The room itself is beautiful, adorned in marble with huge murals upon its walls. There are several benches with cowgirl attendants standing nearby, and you can see a few people getting an oil massage. [flags.KM_BATHS_TEYARIUM
        |Smells as good as ever.
        |So that's why people leaving this place smell so good! The scent wafts over to you — sweet, but not overbearing.
    ]
]

There are quite a few people here, some talking in groups and some alone, unwinding after their time in the hotter rooms or getting ready to enter them. The mood here is a lot more relaxed than the atrium — there's even a servant playing some kind of stringed instrument near the massage benches. This is quite nice.

[var1
    |You could go to the heated pools now that you're cooled off or spend some time here — or head back to the cooler pools in the dinarium, maybe.
    |You could head over to the heated pools in the saldarium, relax here, or go swimming in the cooler pools in the dinarium.
] [var2
    |You tip the cooled water over your head and re-enter the teyarium, sighing in relief. Wow, it's nice to be back in here. You can <b>really</b> understand why people like to relax here after their time in the pools... the atmosphere is perfect for a rest after the heat of the baths. The music the servant is creating drifts over to you, inspiring you to listen.

